{
  "schema_version": 2,
  "title": "How LruCache evicts",
  "intro": "A cache of 2 items just dropped the key you read a second ago. That read should have kept it. We go through what the cache is for, how eviction works and why reads count as use. Watch which key moves on every read.",
  "seed": 7,
  "plan": {
